    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/8ca71cbee2eb659ea12ed2dabc3ed39f.avif?t=1717480382\" /></div><br><br><br>Sit in the cockpit of the first battalion commander of the Tactical Response Unit (T.R.U.), a newly established joint multi-service military task force. T.R.U. stands as a swift and decisive response force designed to neutralize threats efficiently. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/7e957096f999f729bb9dca6de68f6fa9.poster.avif?t=1717480382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/7e957096f999f729bb9dca6de68f6fa9.webm?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/7e957096f999f729bb9dca6de68f6fa9.mp4?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Born in the wake of a devastating assault on the United Alliance homeland, T.R.U. is charged with executing a range of search and destroy missions to safeguard our nation's security. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/11ddd9338b215127cadf635b0157806d.avif?t=1717480382\" /></div><br>As the commander, you must lead your team with precision and strategy to combat the dangers that threaten our borders.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/33571c5f0ca52015d9882db65cd656ea.avif?t=1717480382\" /></div><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tDynamic Gameplay: Take on daring missions to seek and destroy enemy units, rescue, refuel, and upgrade your arsenal to overcome the odds!<br></li><li>\tEngaging Campaign: Immerse yourself in a fast-paced storyline while mastering new aircraft.<br></li><li>\tRefreshed mechanics: Experience a beloved perspective revitalized with better graphics, more speed, and bigger explosive action.<br></li><li>\tQuick Combat Missions: Jump into fast-paced sorties perfect for players on the move or with limited time.<br></li><li>\tAdaptive Challenge: Enjoy balanced gameplay where enemies scale with your skill level, ensuring an enjoyable experience for both beginners and veterans.<br></li><li>\tChallenge yourself: Test your skills with VIP pickups, total annihilation of enemy forces, or race against the clock for speedrun glory.<br></li><li>\tDynamic weather: Wind affect your chopper, flares, and boats. Fog and dust obscure visibility, while nighttime operations keep you stealthy, adding unique dynamics to your mission.<br></li><li>\tMap Editor: Design custom missions, adjust location biomes, control weather conditions and time of day, and craft unique challenges to share with the community.<br></li><li>\tControl: Controller, Mouse and Keyboard or Keyboard Only Support.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/e8292b39e2b181eaf896f445f94fb249.poster.avif?t=1717480382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/e8292b39e2b181eaf896f445f94fb249.webm?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/e8292b39e2b181eaf896f445f94fb249.mp4?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/5227e2e8f11834f2997f9bc210f84b49.poster.avif?t=1717480382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/5227e2e8f11834f2997f9bc210f84b49.webm?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/5227e2e8f11834f2997f9bc210f84b49.mp4?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/8ca71cbee2eb659ea12ed2dabc3ed39f.avif?t=1717480382\" /></div><br><br><br>Sit in the cockpit of the first battalion commander of the Tactical Response Unit (T.R.U.), a newly established joint multi-service military task force. T.R.U. stands as a swift and decisive response force designed to neutralize threats efficiently. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/7e957096f999f729bb9dca6de68f6fa9.poster.avif?t=1717480382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/7e957096f999f729bb9dca6de68f6fa9.webm?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/7e957096f999f729bb9dca6de68f6fa9.mp4?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Born in the wake of a devastating assault on the United Alliance homeland, T.R.U. is charged with executing a range of search and destroy missions to safeguard our nation's security. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/11ddd9338b215127cadf635b0157806d.avif?t=1717480382\" /></div><br>As the commander, you must lead your team with precision and strategy to combat the dangers that threaten our borders.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/33571c5f0ca52015d9882db65cd656ea.avif?t=1717480382\" /></div><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tDynamic Gameplay: Take on daring missions to seek and destroy enemy units, rescue, refuel, and upgrade your arsenal to overcome the odds!<br></li><li>\tEngaging Campaign: Immerse yourself in a fast-paced storyline while mastering new aircraft.<br></li><li>\tRefreshed mechanics: Experience a beloved perspective revitalized with better graphics, more speed, and bigger explosive action.<br></li><li>\tQuick Combat Missions: Jump into fast-paced sorties perfect for players on the move or with limited time.<br></li><li>\tAdaptive Challenge: Enjoy balanced gameplay where enemies scale with your skill level, ensuring an enjoyable experience for both beginners and veterans.<br></li><li>\tChallenge yourself: Test your skills with VIP pickups, total annihilation of enemy forces, or race against the clock for speedrun glory.<br></li><li>\tDynamic weather: Wind affect your chopper, flares, and boats. Fog and dust obscure visibility, while nighttime operations keep you stealthy, adding unique dynamics to your mission.<br></li><li>\tMap Editor: Design custom missions, adjust location biomes, control weather conditions and time of day, and craft unique challenges to share with the community.<br></li><li>\tControl: Controller, Mouse and Keyboard or Keyboard Only Support.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/e8292b39e2b181eaf896f445f94fb249.poster.avif?t=1717480382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/e8292b39e2b181eaf896f445f94fb249.webm?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/e8292b39e2b181eaf896f445f94fb249.mp4?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/5227e2e8f11834f2997f9bc210f84b49.poster.avif?t=1717480382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/5227e2e8f11834f2997f9bc210f84b49.webm?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102230/extras/5227e2e8f11834f2997f9bc210f84b49.mp4?t=1717480382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
